@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Publication and author policy
left to right direction
actor Publisher
actor "Policy manager" as Manager
rectangle "Course governance" {
  usecase "UC04 Publish / revoke module" as Publish
  usecase "UC09 Set site/course policy" as Policy
}
Publisher --> Publish
Manager --> Policy
Publish -[hidden]down-> Policy
note right of Publish
Visible unrestricted teaching sources only.
Explicit family-publication profile.
end note
note right of Policy
Courses inherit or tighten the site.
Any source/target lock blocks native copying.
end note
@enduml
